From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: matthane <matthan.evans@icloud.com>
Date: Thu, 5 Nov 2026 22:09:06 -0600
Subject: [PATCH] AMLCodec: mark the end of input in stream mode

Stream mode has no end of input. The decoder waits for more bytes and
the firmware stops fetching short of the write pointer. A drain ends
on an empty output queue, so at a still the last pictures of a Dolby
Vision FEL clip stay in the decoder.
---
 .../VideoPlayer/DVDCodecs/Video/AMLCodec.cpp  | 85 ++++++++++++++++++-
 .../VideoPlayer/DVDCodecs/Video/AMLCodec.h    |  5 ++
 .../DVDCodecs/Video/DVDVideoCodecAmlogic.cpp  |  6 ++
 .../DVDCodecs/Video/DVDVideoCodecAmlogic.h    |  1 +
 4 files changed, 96 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/xbmc/cores/VideoPlayer/DVDCodecs/Video/AMLCodec.cpp b/xbmc/cores/VideoPlayer/DVDCodecs/Video/AMLCodec.cpp
--- a/xbmc/cores/VideoPlayer/DVDCodecs/Video/AMLCodec.cpp
